{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2019-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1548979200, "end_date": 1549583999, "month_true_total": 34, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:15:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "48816048", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059232708", "personaname": "Kyle Notheis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059232708/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2307, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2306, "last_played": 1552774162, "avatar": "4bfdc02822c42b7e6b8569b97b0c44a12a76467d"}, "language": "english", "review": "-Fantastic game.\n-Its a platform shooter with a handful of classes to unlock and choose from. Each class plays COMPLETELY differently. This makes for hours of fresh and unique gameplay.\n-It does have some \"rogue-lite\" elements. Each run has randomized maps, enemies, and loot.\n-Loot/drops give passive bonuses to your character.\n\nFor those of you interested: To my knowledge there is also a Risk of Rain 2 in the making.", "timestamp_created": 1549522000, "timestamp_updated": 1549522000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48805830", "author": {"steamid": "76561198236550520", "personaname": "2dapy", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/notthatnut/", "num_games_owned": 308, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 5069, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3251, "last_played": 1728086904, "avatar": "11ddd18487255c9877d539996bb0398098335c06"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes, holy ♥♥♥♥ yes.\nThis game is so good.\nIt's really creative in its design, and it has really intuitive gameplay.\nIt's not very replayable; most games like this aren't. The 70+ hours I have are really a lot for this type of game. However, it's really fun and worth playing for however little time you will.\nRisk of Rain 2 had better be as good or else I'm going to cry.", "timestamp_created": 1549479128, "timestamp_updated": 1549479128, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48790594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041057708", "personaname": "vlam ⛧", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/-vlam/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 3937, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3937, "last_played": 1659579483, "avatar": "bb6abc7dcce6be859d06d7e1c062cd2443cf0ba9"}, "language": "english", "review": "No ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ way Take-Two added a spyware EULA to a game that is 12 years old.....\nAs of Feb 2025, it would appear so.\n\nWell lads. It was fun. Time to start voting against these anti-consumer practices with your wallet.\nNever touching another Gearbox/2K/Take-Two published game again.", "timestamp_created": 1549428124, "timestamp_updated": 1747586182, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48783646", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042840628", "personaname": "Bit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042840628/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 562, "